  "notes": "EDG output breaker 152-1703 and PT-1/relays are functionally related but no explicit containment language justifying PART_OF; modeled as separate Component nodes in the causal chain via LEADS_TO instead. No backup/BACKED_UP_BY edges asserted: narrative does not state another EDG or system was confirmed operable/available during this specific inoperability window (train redundancy implied by plant design but not explicitly stated as operable backup during event). Contributing cause (operability determination gaps) modeled as a parallel FailureMode leading to the same Consequence, since it delayed declaration rather than causing the PT failure itself. Previous occurrences section explicitly states no similar prior PT failures were found, so no SIMILAR_TO/stub LER was created per that negative finding."
